WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.620
Hello I'm a citizen. And I'm the
government.

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:06.360
So do you work for me or are you like my dad?

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:10.680
Just think of me as the things that we do together.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.900
Together.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.620
Hello I'm a citizen. And I'm the
government.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.120
Hey it's tax season, how much do I owe
you guys?

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.680
Oh you have to figure that out for yourself.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.400
Do you know how much I owe
you?

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.360
Oh yeah we know, but we're not gonna tell
you, you have to figure it out.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.120
What happens if I get it wrong?

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:39.920
Well then you owe us more, and you might go to prison.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.540
Hello I'm a citizen. And I'm the
government.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.000
Hey you guys outlawed marijuana.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.860
Yes, it is worse than cocaine.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:53.220
Uh, can I see some studies to back that up?

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:57.320
You know it's real hard to find scientific studies on that kind of subject.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.640
Because you outlawed it?

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.720
Yes it is worse than cocaine.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:05.200
Hello I'm a citizen. And I'm the
government.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:10.720
Hey I'm social distancing and I wanted to check to see if you'd resolve those testing issues.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.320
I'm sorry I don't know which ones you're talking about.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:16.060
The...tests that the CDC screwed up?

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:18.480
Yeah you're going to need to be a bit more specific.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.820
How many tests did the CDC screw up?

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:25.380
I can't--I can't hear you, I can't hear because of the Blue Angels--look at that--flying over.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:28.060
Oh that's so cool!

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:29.260
You're welcome.

